<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Thank you for your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. You have reached the fourth demise.<PG>
It seems Erina Goto was able to close in quite near to the heart of it.<PG>
In other words, can we consider that with the information so far, the whole picture can be uncovered to some extent?<PG>
Now then, I will guide you to the next branch. The next branch is―<PG>
Having come this far, you may be able to guess, more or less.<PG>
The heart of the incident becoming clear, too, is not far off, one might say.<PG>
The next is the fifth route. The number of endings you arrive at is rather large as well, but I would be glad if you would keep me company a while longer.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "立木三日,立木ボード,プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
